{
  "description": "Shared conformance cases for the verdict contract. tests/unit/contracts/test_verdict_contract.py and services/agent/tests/core/verdict-contract.test.ts run every case in both languages. cases: each document goes through the JSON Schema and through the language's validator, and all three answers must agree. provenance: resolve_authored / resolveAuthored against map must give authored. assembly: verdict_from_model_output / verdictFromModelOutput on raw with the stamp must succeed (ok) with the stated verdict, authored values and gaps, or fail (Python raises pydantic.ValidationError, TypeScript returns {ok: false}).",
